ath": "/@hitsujiniku_12/works/99", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/21ab3411/uploads/origins/31979486-1e59-4210-bf2d-17f0dc63932a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84e220054e69760c35fc3087ce5be60f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21ab3411/uploads/origins/31979486-1e59-4210-bf2d-17f0dc63932a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84e220054e69760c35fc3087ce5be60f, https://si.imgix.net/21ab3411/uploads/origins/31979486-1e59-4210-bf2d-17f0dc63932a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6099d68aade5b9dbe777ad596119aabb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21ab3411/uploads/origins/31979486-1e59-4210-bf2d-17f0dc63932a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ea6f0fb1447d3febb5d37708f548049 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "SNS等で使う代理ちゃんを依頼させていただきます。\n\n＊依頼内容\nSNS他連絡ツール（主にTwitter,Discord,Misskey.io等々）用代理ちゃんの立ち絵をお願いしたいです。\n各種サイト利用に当たり、全体だけではなくアイコンとしてトリミングする場合があります。\n＊容姿\n・黒～黒紫ぐらいのロング髪\n・狐娘\n・「ゲームするチルノと大妖精さん」くらいの等身\n・洋服はジャージかTシャツ\n・人耳の有無はおまかせします\n・二次ではないので基本全部おまかせでお願いします\n　※らむくんに狐っ娘描いてほしい欲とアイコン欲の混合\n\n＊他\n・背景は不要です\n・画風はらむ絵がBigloveなので、そんな感じでお願いしたいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hitsujiniku_12/works/98", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d977e603/uploads/origins/149a46d6-e189-4feb-b083-0bf0097d5908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7df3078ba488716770f896e9e9798b67", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d977e603/uploads/origins/149a46d6-e189-4feb-b083-0bf0097d5908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7df3078ba488716770f896e9e9798b67, https://si.imgix.net/d977e603/uploads/origins/149a46d6-e189-4feb-b083-0bf0097d5908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d01329570ce7e0cf6b96b51b8b63d8a9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d977e603/uploads/origins/149a46d6-e189-4feb-b083-0bf0097d5908?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50a4a5df19a9271f1644b84c6cab3e05 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "mother (used by children of court nobles and noble families)\n\nThank you for the wonderful Mr. Cirno and the Great Fairy last time.\nMay I ask the doctor to do the same two people again in a dinner situation?\n\nI will repost the material image URL just in case.\nhttps://twitter.com/ARINOMI7/status/1549022259926695938\n　No particular difference in height and body shape between the two of them, vine flats, thin chest\n　They have distinctive wings as shown in the document\n　They are a friendly duo, always spending time together like lovers\n　I have the impression that they are\n\nThis time, I would like to ask for a portrait of the two of them having a meal together.\nI would like to leave the composition, clothing, and other situations to you.\n(We are open to any location, such as cafes, restaurants, pubs, and homes.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you would consider our proposal.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hitsujiniku_12/works/97", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/718ea086/uploads/origins/6624b480-3dde-4a8b-b63e-6637b61caf2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f0803c6f7cb3702a2bb03c1be6abf80", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/718ea086/uploads/origins/6624b480-3dde-4a8b-b63e-6637b61caf2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f0803c6f7cb3702a2bb03c1be6abf80, https://si.imgix.net/718ea086/uploads/origins/6624b480-3dde-4a8b-b63e-6637b61caf2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8879f40bc1d74dfdafed3cc1341d8591 2x, https://si.imgix.net/718ea086/uploads/origins/6624b480-3dde-4a8b-b63e-6637b61caf2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ba1d7fdca32a002a8f51cd35505ccaa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI like your illustrations very much.\nIf you don't mind, please draw an illustration of my child and my friend!\n\n◆Usage\nUse on SNS such as twitter\n\n◆Reference materials for three views and characters\nhttps://twitter.com/silas_012/status/1624678045637550083?s=20\n\n◆Situation\nWe would like you to draw a scene in which a girl friend of ours takes care of our child who got overtired at a hot spring.\n\nComposition\nThe illustration here is close to the image of the composition.\nhttps://skeb.jp/@hitsujiniku_12/works/69\n\nBased on this composition, please draw our child in the foreground and a friend holding and caring for her from behind.\n\n◆friend's girl\nhttps://skeb.jp/@25company_/works/27\nPlease design the friend's character as the girl in this illustration.\nWe would be very happy if you could depict their relationship in a way that conveys from the scene that they have a special closeness and are very close to each other.\n\n◆Clothes\nPlease dress both of them in yukata, which is typical of a hot spring hotel.\nIdeally, the yukata should be loose and bare at the bosom.\n\n◆Delivery\nPSD and PNG format.\n\nThat's all,\nThe information provided is only a reference image, so feel free to arrange it as you wish.\nWe would appreciate your consideration.\nThank you in advance for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hitsujiniku_12/works/96", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3d7eb39/uploads/origins/16ae0dbd-76a4-476c-a447-21ea227a102d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6db363a83cb3b3a5b431dfef7c10e22", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3d7eb39/uploads/origins/16ae0dbd-76a4-476c-a447-21ea227a102d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6db363a83cb3b3a5b431dfef7c10e22, https://si.imgix.net/b3d7eb39/uploads/origins/16ae0dbd-76a4-476c-a447-21ea227a102d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0279b20838dba44a7f6bc87c3179e995 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3d7eb39/uploads/origins/16ae0dbd-76a4-476c-a447-21ea227a102d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22cc6b9ada5d4c0c88f65dd6dffbd705 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello! I would like to request art of Shamir Nevrand and Kiria Kurono from Fire Emblem. They both would be in their swimsuits. The scenario is the two of them on the beach cuddling, with Kiria sitting in Shamir’s lap, and they are kissing. The overall mood should be romantic and passionate. They can be on the sand or on a beach chair. I’ve included an example background but feel free to go with something else if you’d like. Thank you!\n\nReferences: https://imgur.com/a/2rQi06N\nBackup Link: https://imgchest.com/p/agyv968j789\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2rQi06N", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}